<title>FRANCE: Bic H1 1997 sales rise 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Bic H1 1997 sales rise 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					3,693    vs    3,167</p>
<p>	 of which Bic			     3,617    vs    3,015</p>
<p>	 fo which Guy Laroche			76    vs	152</p>
<p>NOTE - The company released the figures in a statement. It said that on a like-for-like basis sales of the Bic unit would have risen 12 percent, of which four percent due to acquisitions.</p>
<p>The company said it did not expect a rise in sales in the second half of 1997 equal to the rise in the first half because the rise in second half 1996 sales was so strong.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 cnn</p>
</text>
